    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大星爸爸在地上，他的东西也都在地上。",
      "traditional": "大星爸爸在地上，他的東西也都在地上。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng bà ba zài dì shang tā de dōng xi yě dōu zài dì shang",
      "english": "Daxing’s dad was on the floor, and all his things were on the floor."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他在地上睡觉吗？他怎么了？",
      "traditional": "他在地上睡覺嗎？他怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "tā zài dì shang shuì jiào ma tā zěn me le",
      "english": "Was he sleeping on the floor? What was the matter with him?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我知道大星爸爸今天要去北京。他要去北京工作，五天后会回来。",
      "traditional": "我知道大星爸爸今天要去北京。他要去北京工作，五天後會回來。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zhī dào dà xīng bà ba jīn tiān yào qù běi jīng tā yào qù běi jīng gōng zuò wǔ tiān hòu huì huí lái",
      "english": "I knew that Daxing’s dad was going to Beijing today. He was going to Beijing for work and would be back in five days."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "这个星期大星爸爸的工作太多了，他三天没睡觉了。",
      "traditional": "這個星期大星爸爸的工作太多了，他三天沒睡覺了。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge xīng qī dà xīng bà ba de gōng zuò tài duō le tā sān tiān méi shuì jiào le",
      "english": "Daxing’s dad had too much work this week, and he hadn’t slept for three days. "
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "现在他要睡觉吗？他为什么在地上？",
      "traditional": "現在他要睡覺嗎？他為什麼在地上？",
